  "title": "Product Bundles, Grouped Products, Upsells and Compare | CrestApps for Orchard Core",
  "description": "Kits, sets, suggestions and side by side comparison make a bigger basket and an easier choice. CrestApps sells a bundle at its own price with its stock worked out from its parts, groups products on one page with one Add to cart, adds upsells and cross-sells, and lets shoppers compare up to four products.\n\nIn this video:\n• Why bundles and recommendations, and the four features\n• Selling a bundle: Made of, its own price and its stock\n• Grouping products on one page\n• Upsells, cross-sells, related and recently viewed products\n• Comparing products side by side",
